assertion  XSH.catanh.011
anchor     functions/catanh.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
says       For catanh, w is the argument. w = +Inf + iNaN gives +0 + iNaN.
note       The tag on this passage is the IEC 60559 Complex Floating-Point
           option; the test is NOTINUSE unless the C implementation claims it
